  ],
  "compare": [
    {
      "words": "beautiful, lovely, pretty, handsome",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "这四个词都有“好看的，漂亮的”的意思。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "beautiful"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 可以修饰人（不修饰男人）和物。它所表示的“美丽”包括美学上所讲的美。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "“Why are you doing that?” Sally asked. “To make myself "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "beautiful"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ",” the lady answered. “你为什么干这个呀？”沙莉问道。“使自己漂亮呀，”那妇人回答道。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "We are now living in a "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "beautiful"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " new house in the country. 我们现在住在农村一座美丽的新房子里。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "handsome"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 修饰的人多半是英俊、健壮的男性，有时用来形容女性的仪态端庄、高贵。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "He is a "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "handsome"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " man. 他是一位美男子。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "One of the most "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "handsome"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " cars was a Rolls-Royce Silver Ghost. 最漂亮的汽车之一，是一辆劳斯莱斯银魅汽车。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "lovely"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 不仅含有使人赏心悦目的意思，而且还含有能够刺激强烈感情的意思。这种感情上的喜悦可以是视觉的感受，也可以是嗅觉或触觉的感受。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "She is a "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "lovely"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " woman. 她是位美丽动人的女子。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "It’s a "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "lovely"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " vase. Those flowers are "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "lovely"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ", too. 这是个美丽的花瓶，那些花也美丽。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "pretty"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 表示以其娇嫩、端庄、迷人等品质使人感到愉快，但并不强调外形的完善或风格的典雅，通常不用 pretty 来修饰庞然大物或身材高大的女子，因为这个词暗含小巧玲珑的意思。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Those girls are very "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "pretty"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ". 那些姑娘很漂亮。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "We like them in the same way that we like "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "pretty"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " curtain material. 我们喜欢它们就像我们喜欢美丽的窗帘料子一样。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
